OL,3,APlan for Northern Olympics to get #7m
OL,4,Ain Healey's Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #7m fund to explore how the Olympics
OL,7,Fcould be brought to northern England
OL,8,Fwill be announced in John Healey's
OL,9,Ffirst Budget on Wednesday, the BBC has
OL,10,Flearned.
OL,12,FThe chancellor plans to allocate the
OL,13,Fmoney for a full feasibility study on
OL,14,Fthe possibility for a bid for a
OL,15,F"Northern Games".
OL,17,FIf successful, it could see the games
OL,18,Fheld in the North in the 2040s.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
